### 1. 添加红军单位 (坦克)
POST http://localhost:8080/combat/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "红军-T99主战坦克营",
  "side": "RED",
  "type": "TANK",
  "combatPower": 100,
  "location": "A区-高地",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. 添加蓝军单位 (步兵)
POST http://localhost:8080/combat/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "蓝军-机械化步兵连",
  "side": "BLUE",
  "type": "INFANTRY",
  "combatPower": 80,
  "location": "B区-平原",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 3. 查看当前所有兵力
GET http://localhost:8080/combat/list

### 4. 开始一次战斗模拟
POST http://localhost:8080/combat/start